- 新想法|做什么 -> incubate(/bootstrap) + skills/cto-translator/SKILL.md
- 改功能|加模块 -> save+impact+verify + skills/surgical-guard/SKILL.md
- 查真假|体检 -> audit/xray + skills/reality-xray/SKILL.md
